Comment: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:37.97,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Lost in a world where I cannot see, even the answers slip away from me
Comment: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:50.07,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Memories fade, their threads intertwine
Comment: 0,0:00:50.57,0:01:01.27,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Searching... for the shape of you in time
Comment: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:15.34,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Now I reach my hand straight toward you, no one else, only you
Comment: 0,0:01:15.67,0:01:29.15,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I remember what matters most, at last I can face you, heart to heart
Comment: 0,0:01:29.49,0:01:37.42,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Stay beside me, always
Comment: 0,0:01:46.78,0:01:57.65,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Beyond this sky I entrust my soul, with our bond strong, unbroken, and whole
Comment: 0,0:01:57.65,0:01:58.47,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I can...
Comment: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:12.18,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}...see the feelings deep inside, I won't lose my way again
Comment: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:36.34,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Now I reach my hand straight toward you. No one else, only you
Comment: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:50.24,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I remember what matters most, at last I can face you, heart to heart
